<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the seventh day at the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Women's singles, fourth round</p>
<p>Mary Pierce (France) beat 5-Anke Huber (Germany) 6-2 6-3  </p>
<p>Add women's singles, fourth round</p>
<p>Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat 7-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) 7-6 (15-13) 6-4  </p>
<p>Add men's singles, fourth round</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) 6-3 1-6 3-6 6-2 6-4  </p>
<p>Add men's singles, fourth round:</p>
<p>2-Michael Chang beat Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 4-6 6-2 6-2 6-1 14-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat MaliVai Washington (U.S.) 7-5 6-2 6-1  </p>
<p>Add women's singles, fourth round:</p>
<p>12-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat 1-Steffi Graf (Germany) 6-2 7-5  </p>
<p>Men's singles, fourth round</p>
<p>9-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat 7-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) 4-6 6-4 7-6 (7-4) 6-7 (5-7) 6-3</p>
</text>
